{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正逐步從持續一整天的服務中斷事件中恢復。此前，公司大量系統遭遇連鎖式軟件故障。故障始於周四，最初標記為僅影響美國及美洲區域的服務；但由於工程師難以恢復宕機伺服器，問題很快蔓延至全球。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586298.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:22:48.549108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T14:11:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:15:58.620331+00:00","content_hash":"d4e846ad9828cab5731f7fb664ff68c6fbb5bd965d45a2744d31fd04ff8ad486","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}